WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.534 --> 00:00:17.678
"What's he doing here?" Perda whispered, peering into the throne room at Morb.

2
00:00:17.679 --> 00:00:20.073
Zann pressed a finger to his lips.

3
00:00:20.074 --> 00:00:24.582
He didn't know why Morb had returned to the palace. But he wanted to find out.

4
00:00:24.583 --> 00:00:28.135
All over the throne room, people were reacting to Morb's arrival.

5
00:00:28.136 --> 00:00:31.379
"Someone call the guards!" Rixa shouted.

6
00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:34.701
"What have you done with the king and queen?" someone else demanded.

7
00:00:34.702 --> 00:00:41.376
Another man marched over to Morb. "Your presence here is highly unacceptable!" he declared.

8
00:00:41.377 --> 00:00:49.798
Morb just sat there, smiling calmly. "Is that any way to speak to the new king of Magica?"

9
00:00:49.799 --> 00:00:53.140
"This has gone on long enough!" Rixa shouted.

10
00:00:53.141 --> 00:00:56.641
"It was a mistake for you to show your face here again.

11
00:00:56.642 --> 00:01:01.757
By the power of the government of Magica, I hereby pronounce you under arrest."

12
00:01:01.758 --> 00:01:07.303
Rubbing her hands together, Rixa pointed at Morb. "Immobilize!" she intoned.

13
00:01:07.304 --> 00:01:13.802
Energy shot from her fingertips. Chuckling, Morb casually held up his hand to block the spell.

14
00:01:13.803 --> 00:01:17.959
The spell bounced off Morb's hand and struck Rixa instead.

15
00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:24.368
"No!" she cried as her entire body went stiff. "You can't do this!"

16
00:01:24.369 --> 00:01:28.740
"Ah, but I can." Morb leaned back on the throne.

17
00:01:28.741 --> 00:01:34.007
Glancing around the room, he added, "Would anyone else like to try to arrest me?"

18
00:01:34.008 --> 00:01:42.175
Nobody said a word. Zann spotted a few people exchanging nervous glances, while others stared fearfully at the hulking trolls.

19
00:01:42.176 --> 00:01:51.326
"Nobody? Are you sure?" Morb stared at a white-haired old man. "How about you? Speak up, man!"

20
00:01:51.327 --> 00:01:53.967
Morb pointed his finger at the old man.

21
00:01:53.968 --> 00:01:58.773
Energy sizzled outward, dragging the man forward as if he'd been caught by a fishhook.

22
00:01:58.774 --> 00:02:06.250
"We have to do something!" Perda whispered as Morb pinned the white-haired man against the ceiling with a Levitation spell.

23
00:02:06.251 --> 00:02:11.260
"Like what?" Zann said. "If Morb sees us, we're doomed!"

24
00:02:11.261 --> 00:02:14.844
Tired of toying with the old man, Morb let him fall.

25
00:02:14.845 --> 00:02:21.378
Fortunately the man quickly rubbed his hands together and slowed down just in time to land safely on the floor.

26
00:02:21.379 --> 00:02:24.298
"Anyone else?" Morb asked.

27
00:02:24.299 --> 00:02:27.186
Slib cleared his throat and stepped forward.

28
00:02:27.187 --> 00:02:33.458
"I have something to say," he announced loudly. He bowed toward Morb.

29
00:02:33.459 --> 00:02:38.257
"I will be honored to serve the new King of Magica."

30
00:02:38.258 --> 00:02:42.216
There were murmurs of dismay from all over the room.

31
00:02:42.217 --> 00:02:49.456
Morb raised one eyebrow. "I see," he said, sounding amused. "What's your name?"

32
00:02:49.457 --> 00:02:54.088
"I am Slib, Your Majesty. At your service."

33
00:02:54.089 --> 00:02:56.714
Zann didn't hear what Morb said next.

34
00:02:56.715 --> 00:03:01.200
Zann had just noticed Zing pawing at a beetle on the floor nearby.

35
00:03:01.201 --> 00:03:05.640
"Zing!" Zann whispered as loudly as he dared. "Quiet!"

36
00:03:05.641 --> 00:03:10.974
Zing glanced at him. The beetle took the opportunity to dart into a crack in the floor.

37
00:03:10.975 --> 00:03:15.644
When Zing realized the beetle had escaped, he let out a whistle of annoyance.

38
00:03:15.645 --> 00:03:19.214
"Zing, hush!" Gliss whispered anxiously.

39
00:03:19.215 --> 00:03:26.591
Zann peeked into the throne room. Morb and the others were too far away to hear Zing's whistle. But something else had heard it.

40
00:03:26.592 --> 00:03:32.120
Zann gasped as he saw a bunch of the tiny, stinging dragons swarming toward them.

41
00:03:32.121 --> 00:03:37.041
"Run!" Zann whispered frantically.

42
00:03:37.042 --> 00:03:41.402
The tiny dragons were fast. They caught up with the kids halfway down the hall.

43
00:03:41.403 --> 00:03:46.317
"Get away!" Gliss cried, batting at the creatures buzzing around her hair.

44
00:03:46.318 --> 00:03:50.489
Zing let out a whistle as another tiny dragon darted in and stung him.

45
00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:54.779
He blasted it with flames, but three more flew over and took its place.

46
00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:58.054
"Should we zap away?" Perda exclaimed.

47
00:03:58.055 --> 00:04:00.890
Zann grimaced as one of the dragons stung him.

48
00:04:00.891 --> 00:04:04.816
"We can't," he said, gritting his teeth against the pain.

49
00:04:04.817 --> 00:04:08.801
"Not with Morb so close. He might still be tracking us."

50
00:04:08.802 --> 00:04:12.625
"Zann's right." Darb ducked as a dragon tried to strike him.

51
00:04:12.626 --> 00:04:15.175
"We've got to lose them some other way."

52
00:04:15.176 --> 00:04:20.406
"But how?" Gliss was trying to shield her head with her arms as she ran.

53
00:04:20.407 --> 00:04:26.561
The kids rounded another corner. Just ahead was a small courtyard with a large fountain in the middle.

54
00:04:26.562 --> 00:04:33.096
"There!" Zann cried, pointing. "Run under the fountain. Maybe that'll slow them down."

55
00:04:33.097 --> 00:04:37.906
He led the way out to the courtyard, leaping into the water and racing through the spray.

56
00:04:37.907 --> 00:04:45.580
As soon as the stinging dragons flew under the water, they were knocked into the pool. They popped up, sputtering and drenched.

57
00:04:45.581 --> 00:04:49.539
Zann and the others raced into another room on the other side of the courtyard.

58
00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:53.636
Darb glanced back. "The dragons are still coming!" he cried.

59
00:04:53.637 --> 00:04:56.234
"What dragons?" a new voice asked.

60
00:04:56.235 --> 00:04:59.668
Zann saw someone step into the room. It was Yog!

61
00:04:59.669 --> 00:05:07.414
"What's going on?" Yog looked confused as a few tiny, wet dragons buzzed into the room. "Where did those come from?"

62
00:05:07.415 --> 00:05:10.949
"Morb brought them!" Perda said breathlessly.

63
00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:16.871
Yog rubbed his hands together. A glowing purple wall sprang up, blocking the stinging dragons.

64
00:05:16.872 --> 00:05:21.621
"There," Yog said. "Now, what's this about Morb? He's here in the palace?"

65
00:05:21.622 --> 00:05:24.782
Zann and his friends told Yog the whole story.

66
00:05:24.783 --> 00:05:29.803
Yog healed their stings while he listened. By the end he looked grim.

67
00:05:29.804 --> 00:05:33.221
"A magic-sucking machine, huh?" he said.

68
00:05:33.222 --> 00:05:38.394
"I've heard stories about that machine. I always thought they were just tall tales from the Old Times."

69
00:05:38.395 --> 00:05:43.173
"They're not," Gliss said. "At least Morb's trolls don't think so."

70
00:05:43.174 --> 00:05:46.536
"I'd better go see what's happening in the throne room," Yog said.

71
00:05:46.537 --> 00:05:50.157
"You kids should get out of the palace before Morb realizes you're here."

72
00:05:50.158 --> 00:05:53.164
"But we want to help!" Perda said.

73
00:05:53.165 --> 00:05:58.629
"You can help by finding Fala and telling her what happened," replied Yog, already heading for the door.

74
00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:02.988
"She'll know how to contact Venna and the others. There's no time to lose!"

75
00:06:02.989 --> 00:06:04.912
"He's right," Darb said.

76
00:06:04.913 --> 00:06:10.292
Zann nodded. "Let's get out of here. I think the exit is this way."

77
00:06:10.293 --> 00:06:13.310
He raced down the hallway and around the corner.

78
00:06:13.311 --> 00:06:21.162
"Oof!" he grunted as he smacked headlong into a running troll.
